    <item>
      <title>微小的震动并不总能警告水力压裂何时会引发更大的地震</title>
      <link>https://www.sciencenews.org/article/tremors-warn-fracking-bigger-earthquake</link>
      <description><![CDATA[一项对 70,000 次地震的研究发现，微小的震动往往发生在与水力压裂相关的较大地震之前，这为停止注液提供了警告。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.sciencenews.org/article/tremors-warn-fracking-bigger-earthquake</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 18:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
